  ('c_guitar_chord_c_major', 'C guitar chord (C Major)', 5, 1, '[{"string":2,"fret":1,"finger":1},{"string":4,"fret":2,"finger":2},{"string":5,"fret":3,"finger":3}]', NULL, '[6]', '[1,3]', NULL, 'M, maj', '1-3-5', 'C-E-G', 'Press the B (2nd) string on the 1st fret with your index finger | With your middle finger, press down on the D (4th) string at the 2nd fret | Position your ring finger on the A (5th) string at the 3rd fret and press down | Now, strum all the strings starting from the 5th string', strftime('%s', 'now') * 1000, strftime('%s', 'now') * 1000),
